-- soundness alone is free: the family of every configuration is sound for every problem, and refuses
-- nothing (vacuous-report, unit-warrant-not-informative). "Solved" is soundness with tightness.
everything-sound : (C : Type 0) → (F : FoldProblem C) → Sound C F (λ x → Unit)
everything-sound C F = λ b x m → unit
